SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Jefferson's Bourbon | Session I
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 2 spots l
 eft\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/207953\n\nJoin us for an intimate tasting experience with Jefferson�
 �s Bourbon\, exploring the craftsmanship\, character\, and creativity behi
 nd each pour. The evening begins with a welcome cocktail and time to mingl
 e before a guided tasting led by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller. A Ken
 tucky native with deep family ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller founded J
 efferson’s with his father in 1997 and has become known for challenging 
 bourbon tradition through inventive approaches to aging and blending\, ear
 ning him a place in the Kentucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straight tast
 ing pours are passed\, Trey will share the story of Jefferson’s while gu
 iding members through the flavor profiles\, production process\, and disti
 nctive character of each selection. Following the tasting\, the evening op
 ens back up for conversation\, giving members the opportunity to mingle\, 
 revisit their favorites\, and connect with Trey one-on-one for questions a
 nd a deeper dive into the world of Jefferson’s Bourbon.\n\n*This event i
 s complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites a
 nd refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be ma
 de at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207953
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
