DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 4 spots l
 eft\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.
 com/events/206917\n\nJoin us for an intimate tasting experience with Jeffe
 rson’s Bourbon\, exploring the craftsmanship\, character\, and creativit
 y behind each pour. The evening begins with a welcome cocktail and time to
  mingle before a guided tasting led by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller.
  A Kentucky native with deep family ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller fou
 nded Jefferson’s with his father in 1997 and has become known for challe
 nging bourbon tradition through inventive approaches to aging and blending
 \, earning him a place in the Kentucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straigh
 t tasting pours are passed\, Trey will share the story of Jefferson’s wh
 ile guiding members through the flavor profiles\, production process\, and
