SUMMARY:Art Tour: Alexandre Gallery Exhibition
LOCATION:Meet in The Lobby
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 15 spots left\nS
 tatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/20895
 7\n\nPlease join 'Quin House art curator\, Kate Chertavian for a tour of t
 he 'Quin's Fall exhibition in collaboration with Alexandre Gallery featuri
 ng two generations of female New England artists.\n\nThe exhibition showca
 ses ten works by influential plein air painter\, Lois Dodd\, a key figure 
 in New York's post-war art scene\, celebrated for her depictions of the Ma
 ine landscape. Alongside Dodd's work\, the exhibition highlights paintings
  by her artistic peers Loren MacIver and Pat Adams\, as well as contempora
 ry New England artists\, Tessa Greene O'Brien\, Lisa Sanditz and Emily Nel
 ligan.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/208957
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
