 ed to bring members together. Settle in\, enjoy a selection of charcuterie
 \, and strike up a conversation among familiar faces and new connections a
 like.\n\nWhether you are expanding your circle\, exchanging ideas\, or sim
 ply stopping by for a drink and lively conversation\, Member Mingle offers
  the perfect opportunity to connect with the community\, enjoy a bite\, an
 d see where the evening takes you.\n\n*This event is complimentary and res
 erved for members only. Complimentary light bites will be served\, with be
