DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:5th Anniversary 'House Celebration: A Night of Gathering & Impact
LOCATION:Offsite: MGM Music Hall
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: 
 Available\nTime: 6 PM – 10 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.c
 om/events/195306\n\nTicket Presale: Now Open! \n\nIn celebration of five
  remarkable years\, The ’Quin invites you to an evening honoring our com
 munity of leaders\, creators\, innovators and rising stars\, who believe t
 hat good things happen when great people come together to further our miss
 ion of collective positive impact. Join us for extraordinary performances 
 by EGOT-winning multiplatinum artist and producer John Legend\, and the Gr
 ammy Award-winning Gipsy Kings featuring Nicolas Reyes. A milestone occasi
 on with lasting purpose\, net proceeds will support the philanthropic work
  of The ’Quin Impact Fund.\n\nA landmark year calls for a legendary even
 ing\, please look forward to:\n\n6:00PM | Doors Open\n\n7:15PM | Program B
 egins\n\nwith Opening Act by The Gipsy Kings featuring Nicolas Reyes\n\n8:
 45PM | John Legend\n\nPRESALE ACCESS: Residential Seating Arrangements\n\n
 Now available for reservations - members\, take advantage of presale acces
 s to a bespoke arrangement of cabaret tables\, lounges\, and box seating p
 ackages offering opportunities to enhance your evening. All presale arrang
 ements must be purchased in full\; individual seats and partial arrangemen
 ts are not available during this ticket release. During the presale period
 \, arrangements are limited to one purchase per member-household. \n\nCli
 ck to Explore the Residential Seating Map\n\nCabaret Table (Rows 1–3) | 
 4 seats | $9\,000 - $11\,000 per table\n Seat location on the ground floor
 . Includes access for four to a one-hour pre-show reception in the MassMut
 ual Lounge featuring a dinner buffet and open bar. Prices vary based on cl
 ear vs. partial view obstruction. A beer and wine service\, savory snacks\
 , and dessert will be offered tableside\, included in the ticket price*. 
 \nCabaret Table (Rows 4–5) | 4 seats | $9\,000 per table\n Seat location
  on the ground floor. Includes two backstage passes per table to meet the 
 Gipsy Kings\, as well as beer and wine service and a curated menu of light
  bites offered tableside throughout the evening\, included in the ticket p
 rice*.\nLounge Seating | 8 seats | $22\,000 per table\n Seat location on t
 he ground floor. Includes two backstage passes per lounge to meet John Leg
 end in advance of the performance\, as well as a champagne service\, all b
 everages\, and a curated menu of light bites offered tableside throughout 
 the evening included in the ticket price. \nBox Seating | 4 seats | $9\,0
 00 per table\n Seat location on the second-floor mezzanine. Includes acces
 s for four to a one-hour pre-show reception in the adjacent Jim Beam Loung
 e featuring stationary hors d'oeuvres and an open bar. A beer and wine se
 rvice\, and a curated menu of light bites will be offered tableside throug
 hout the evening\, included in the ticket price*.\n\n*Please note this eve
 nt is reserved for ages 21+ in keeping with the club's policy. All other f
 ood and beverages will be offered to guests for purchase à la carte on co
 nsumption from the bars located on these floors. \n\nTo request your pref
 erred seating arrangement\, please\n\nENTER YOUR INTEREST HERE!\n\n*Reques
 ts are subject to availability and will be returned in the order of receip
 t by our Impact Concierge. If your selection is available\, the non-tax-de
 ductible portion of the purchase price will be charged to your payment met
 hod on file as a deposit and the Concierge Team will contact you with inst
 ructions for making the donation balance.\n\nMORE WAYS TO JOIN THE CELEBRA
 TION!\n\nPrefer to join us as a party of two? Additional theatre seating s
 panning Ground through Floor Three will be offered in an additional ticket
  release on Wednesday\, October 14 through Ticketmaster. Members will re
 ceive access to tickets ranging from $25 - $2\,829/each\, inclusive of tax
 es and fees\, available for individual purchase and purchase as pairs. We
  won't let you miss this additional ticket drop! Look forward to a reminde
 r email\, in advance of the drop date containing a 'Quin Member password t
 hat will unlock these tickets and extend the link to purchase.\n\nLARGER P
 ARTY? NOW IS THE TIME...\n\nWe understand\, you're social! If the above se
 ating arrangements do not meet your needs\, consider the Sponsored Group B
 lock theatre seating arrangement for groups of six\, eight\, or ten. This
  is a ground floor\, center section with limited availability on a first t
 o reserve basis - available now during presale. All Sponsored Group Block
 s must be purchased in full\; individual seats and partial arrangements ar
 e not available during this ticket release. Interested? Please enter your
  group size here\, and look forward to an email from our Concierge Team wh
 o will support you with visibility into any available seating arrangements
  and reservations.\n\nShould you require assistance or have any related qu
 estions please email the dedicated Impact Concierge Team at Impact5More@th
 equin.com. We look forward to celebrating with you in November!       
  \n\n*Please note that The ‘Quin House will close at 3:00PM on this dat
 e to ensure access to this celebration for the entire ‘Quin House Team.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195306
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
