SUMMARY:'Quin Suite: Celtics vs. Hornets
LOCATION:Offsite - TD Garden
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: $475.00 per person\nStatus: Av
 ailable\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207108\n\nSett
 le in for a night of Celtics basketball from one of the best vantage point
 s in the Garden. Join fellow members in The ’Quin Suite (#524) as the Ce
 ltics face off against the Charlotte Hornets for an exciting regular-seas
 on matchup.\n\nAll suite ticket options include incredible views of the on
 -court action and light gameday bites and an assortment of refreshments i
 ncluding wine\, beer and seltzer. Are you game?\n\n*A pair of 'Quin suite 
 seats is available for $995 total ($497.50 per ticket). Individual suite 
 tickets are available for bar stool / standing access only\, offered at a 
 reduced price of $475 per ticket. Suite tickets are non-refundable and ar
 e non-transferable. Members may purchase tickets for up to 3 guests and ar
 e required to accompany them at all times. The suite is limited to those a
 ges 16+ as a courtesy to fellow members.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207108
