BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-200238@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261203T150000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:'Venture: European Holiday Markets
LOCATION:Offsite: Strasbourg\, Nuremberg\, Vienna\, and Munich
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $10150.00 per person\nSta
 tus: Available\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinho
 use.com/events/200238\n\nThis December\, trade the usual holiday routine f
 or a ‘Venture through the heart of Europe during its most magical season
 . Wander Strasbourg’s storybook streets\, experience Nuremberg’s legen
 dary Christkindlesmarkt\, revel in the grandeur of Vienna\, and savor a fi
 nal taste of Bavaria in Munich. With exceptional dining\, luxury accommoda
 tions\, private transportation\, and time to discover each destination at 
 leisure\, every detail has been thoughtfully considered. \n\nBegin in the
  heart of Alsace\, with two days to wander Strasbourg’s celebrated holid
 ay markets\, half-timbered streets\, artisan stalls\, and historic landmar
 ks\, gathering over Alsatian fare in centuries-old settings along the way.
  From there\, journey east to Nuremberg and the legendary Christkindlesmar
 kt\, one of the world’s oldest holiday markets\, with time to explore th
 e medieval Old Town\, Imperial Castle\, and stalls beneath the Frauenkirch
 e before an evening of Franconian specialties.\n\nThe journey continues to
  Vienna\, where imperial landmarks\, elegant boulevards\, and enchanting h
 oliday markets set the scene for an afternoon in one of Europe’s grandes
 t capitals. Finally\, Bavaria provides a fitting finale in Munich. Wander 
 from Marienplatz to the Viktualienmarkt\, discover neighborhood markets an
 d local boutiques\, and savor one last taste of the season before raising 
 a glass together over a farewell dinner overlooking the National Theatre. 
 An extraordinary journey through the traditions\, flavors\, and unmistakab
 le magic of the European holiday season awaits.\n\nSingle Occupancy | $6\,
 950\n\nDouble Occupancy | $10\,150\n\n*Reservations are non-refundable and
  non-transferable in order to guarantee accommodations during the high se
 ason. Payment is due in full at the time of booking. To ensure the best p
 ossible experience for all attendees\, we kindly ask that members inform u
 s in advance of any physical limitations\, mobility considerations\, or ac
 cessibility needs we should be aware of. All members will also be asked to
  sign The 'Quin's standard liability agreement in advance of travel and mi
 nimum interest must be met to ensure the trip will proceed as planned.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/200238
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
